**inputs.css — Survey form inputs**

[inputs.css#L41-L103](file:///Users/dwahl/Scripts/pantoken/renderers/pendo/src/css/inputs.css#L41-L103):
```css
._pendo-guide-walkthrough_:not([data-layout="tooltipBlank"], [data-layout="lightboxBlank"]) {
  ._pendo-open-text-poll-input {
    /* PMF Survey does not have `rows` attribute, so manually set to match other surveys */
    min-height: 100px;
  }

  :is([id*="survey-pmf-answers"], [id*="survey-single-choice"]) {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  /* PMF survey inputs are inline-block by default, override to stack vertically. */
  :is([id*="survey-pmf-answers"], [id*="survey-single-choice"]) span:has(.pendo-radio) {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    justify-content: start;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: left;
  }
}
```

