```

**`pendo-mock-flexbox-row` & `pendo-mock-flexbox-element`** — **NOT layout-scoped** ([lines 47-67](renderers/pendo/src/css/card.css#L47-L67)):
```css
[data-pendo-justify-content] .pendo-mock-flexbox-row {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  align-items: center;
  min-height: 0;
}

[data-pendo-justify-content="flex-start"] .pendo-mock-flexbox-row {
  justify-content: flex-start;
}

/* ... flex-end, center, space-between ... */

[data-pendo-justify-content] .pendo-mock-flexbox-row .pendo-mock-flexbox-element {
  position: static;
}
```
These are keyed off `[data-pendo-justify-content]` attribute, NOT layout variants. They apply globally wherever Pendo marks a row for flexbox replacement.

