**Text/Color Tokens**:
- `--instui-component-banner-color` ([container.css L180](renderers/pendo/src/css/container.css#L180)) — **Primary text color** on banner backgrounds
- **NO separate secondary-text or text-secondary token** — banner relies on single `banner-color`

**Background Tokens**:
- `--instui-component-banner-violet-background` ([container.css L180](renderers/pendo/src/css/container.css#L180))
